&lt;h3 id="各种id相关"&gt;各种ID相关&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一个包包含的ID信息如下：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For a &lt;strong&gt;Request&lt;/strong&gt; packet: TgtID, SrcID, TxnID, StashNID, StashLPID, ReturnNID, ReturnTxnID, PGroupID, StashGroupID, and TagGroupID.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For a &lt;strong&gt;Response packet&lt;/strong&gt;: TgtID, SrcID, TxnID, DBID, PGroupID, StashGroupID, and TagGroupID.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For a &lt;strong&gt;Data packet&lt;/strong&gt;: TgtID, SrcID, TxnID, HomeNID, and DBID.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For a &lt;strong&gt;Snoop packet&lt;/strong&gt;: SrcID, TxnID, FwdNID, FwdTxnID, and StashLPID.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TgtID、SrcID就是源和目的ID，剩余的ID如下介绍：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>RHT NoC: A Reconfigurable Hybrid Topology Architecture for Chiplet-Based Multicore System</title><link>https://leru-sama.github.io/noc/rht_noc/rht_noc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 20:58:23 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://leru-sama.github.io/noc/rht_noc/rht_noc/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这篇论文
&lt;a href="#xuRHTNoCReconfigurable2025" class="citation"&gt;(Dongyu, et al, 2025)&lt;/a&gt;
来自VLSI，今天先看看。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这篇论文做了一个半带宽mesh，然后用一个bufferless tours来弥补半带宽mesh的不足。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="半带宽mesh"&gt;半带宽mesh&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;使用依据是
&lt;a href="#xuRMCNoCReliable2023" class="citation"&gt;(Dongyu, et al, 2023)&lt;/a&gt;
中写的，百分之80情况下的相邻router带宽都是单向的，所以索性就只做半带宽的mesh来节省资源，router之间通过一个channel的adaptable link
&lt;a href="#ditomasoQOREFaultTolerant2014" class="citation"&gt;(Dominic, et al, 2014)&lt;/a&gt;
连接，然后再路由器里面增加了一级LC（link control），用来判定link是朝哪个方向走。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://leru-sama.github.io/noc/rht_noc/router_with_link_controller.jpg"
alt="加入 LC 的 router"onclick="openImageViewer(this)"
style="cursor: pointer;"
/&gt; &lt;figcaption&gt;
&lt;p&gt;加入 LC 的 router&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;style&gt;
.image-viewer {
display: none;
position: fixed;
top: 0;
left: 0;
width: 100%;
height: 100%;
background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
z-index: 9999;
justify-content: center;
align-items: center;
}
.image-viewer.show {
display: flex;
}
.image-viewer img {
max-width: 90%;
max-height: 90%;
object-fit: contain;
}
.image-viewer-close {
position: absolute;
top: 20px;
right: 30px;
color: white;
font-size: 40px;
font-weight: bold;
cursor: pointer;
transition: 0.3s;
}
.image-viewer-close:hover {
color: #bbb;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
function createImageViewer() {
if (!document.getElementById('imageViewer')) {
const viewer = document.createElement('div');
viewer.id = 'imageViewer';
viewer.className = 'image-viewer';
viewer.innerHTML = `
&lt;span class="image-viewer-close" onclick="closeImageViewer()"&gt;&amp;times;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;img id="viewerImage" src="" alt="放大图片"&gt;
`;
document.body.appendChild(viewer);
viewer.addEventListener('click', function(event) {
if (event.target === viewer) {
closeImageViewer();
}
});
document.addEventListener('keydown', function(event) {
if (event.key === 'Escape' &amp;&amp; viewer.classList.contains('show')) {
closeImageViewer();
}
});
}
return document.getElementById('imageViewer');
}
function openImageViewer(imgElement) {
const viewer = createImageViewer();
const viewerImg = document.getElementById('viewerImage');
viewerImg.src = imgElement.src;
viewerImg.alt = imgElement.alt;
viewer.classList.add('show');
document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
}
function closeImageViewer() {
const viewer = document.getElementById('imageViewer');
if (viewer) {
viewer.classList.remove('show');
document.body.style.overflow = '';
}
}
&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LC的判断逻辑是根据两端待传输的flit进行协商，优先传输flit多也就是带宽需求大的。这玩意会带来一个等待链路授权的时间，这个文章里面通过一个bufferless torus解决。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Adapt-NoC: A Flexible Network-on-Chip Design for Heterogeneous Manycore Architectures</title><link>https://leru-sama.github.io/noc/adapt_noc/adapt_noc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 20:56:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://leru-sama.github.io/noc/adapt_noc/adapt_noc/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这篇论文
&lt;a href="#zhengAdaptNoCFlexibleNetworkonChip2021" class="citation"&gt;(Hao, et al, 2021)&lt;/a&gt;
